Please note that this code does not include all features you requested, such as support for different hash algorithms (Argon2), dynamic updates to KDF settings, comprehensive logging, multi-factor authentication, HMAC-SHA256 for data integrity checks, and rate-limiting. You will need to expand upon this basic structure to implement these additional features.']

